kunzite: Adreno 710 steps 11-12, TrustZone (kgpu=11/12; 1-10 unchanged), through TopazModem's
topaz_scm (SiP SMC64 yielding, resumed when interrupted). 11, no memory passed: is_call_available
(itself, then the five PAS calls) and pas_is_supported for 1 ADSP, 4 modem, 9 video, 13 GPU zap.
12: /usr/share/firmware/kunzite/a710_zap.mdt (topaz_fw_read; the phone's /vendor/firmware file,
uploaded once) checked to be ELF32 headers + hash segment only, copied with aligned word writes
into the uncached low-DDR page 0xdff00000 (Android System RAM, never XNU's, below 4 GiB like
Linux's qcom_scm buffer), then PAS_INIT_IMAGE(13, page): TrustZone's signature check. Nothing is
loaded or started; the page is not touched again.

